 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Use bear-resistant bins, keep food in the room at night, or hang it from a roof ridgeline. Keep them a good tent wall between you and the food. A few hundred meters is a lot when you can see right to it. Make a plan with the land manager and only act if it's clear. Stay in your tent and take your backpack off before you open the door. Bear spray is your best defense, and you already have it with you. Keep it where you can reach it quickly.",
